OL,3,GNEWSA'Dolly Parton was lovely, she
OL,4,Agrabbed my hand'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDolly Parton's impact on Lincolnshire
OL,7,Fand East Yorkshire has been shared in a
OL,8,Fhost of tributes to the "icon and
OL,9,Flegend".
OL,11,FThe country singer's death was
OL,12,Fannounced on Tuesday and her team said
OL,13,Fshe had "a brief battle with cancer".
OL,15,FAndrew Percy, a former MP for Brigg and
OL,16,FGoole, was instrumental in setting up
OL,17,FImagination Libraries in North
OL,18,FLincolnshire and Goole, a scheme Parton
OL,19,Flaunched in Britain in 2007.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
