OL,3,GNEWSA'Dolly Parton was lovely, she
OL,4,Agrabbed my hand'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPercy, who met Parton when she
OL,7,Fperformed in Leeds, said: "She was
OL,8,Flovely, really sweet. She grabbed my
OL,9,Fhand. She just seemed to be the Dolly
OL,10,FParton that we all think we know and
OL,11,Flove behind the scenes."
